# UC08 — Questions + Ground-Truth Answers

100 distinct hand-written questions asked against the same 29-doc Normain compliance corpus (Simple mode). Each question is asked verbatim across all competitors. Ground truth authored from a direct read of the documents in `data-sources/`.

## How competitors are asked

- Ingest the 29 documents listed in `corpus.md` into a fresh session/project.
- For each question below, paste the question text verbatim per the prompt block in `competitors/<tool>.md`. No extra system prompt, no preamble.
- Capture: prompt, full answer text, full-session PDF, screenshot, anomaly notes.

## Mix

- **Types.** 50 Y/N · 40 FF · 10 CL · 5 🪤 (Y/N : qualitative = 50 : 50).
- **Depth.** 30 L1 · 30 L2 · 20 L3 · 20 L4 (5 traps + 15 negative-answer L4).
- **Consistency pairs (5).** P1 Q002↔Q091 · P2 Q008↔Q095 · P3 Q021↔Q024 · P4 Q051↔Q054 · P5 Q061↔Q064. Answers in each pair must not contradict.
- **Traps (5).** Q020, Q030, Q058, Q080, Q099 — correct answer is "Not addressed in our documentation."
- **Negative-answer L4 (15).** Q009, Q010, Q018, Q028, Q029, Q039, Q048, Q049, Q059, Q069, Q077, Q079, Q089, Q097, Q098 — corpus does not support "yes"; correct answer is "No" with rationale.

## Citation convention

`[doc-filename] § [section]` or `[doc-filename] p. [page]`. Doc filenames match `data-sources/`. SoA controls cited as `statement-of-applicability.xlsx § A.x.y`.

